<title>ESTONIA: Estonian GDP grew four pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Estonian GDP grew four pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's gross domestic product (GDP) grew by four percent in 1996, the statistics office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that GDP growth in the fourth quarter of 1996 was 7.3 percent compared with the same quarter in 1995.</p>
<p>It said the figures were preliminary data.</p>
<p>The percentage changes are in constant 1993 prices, the amounts are in current prices.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN GDP			1996    1995   Q4 1996   Q4 1995</p>
<p> Percent rise (yr/yr)	    4.0     4.3    7.3	 1.7</p>
<p> GDP (billions of kroons)	52.4    41.28  14.5	11.62</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
